# Issue: #4
Feature: Draft Issue
  Interview for a feature or bug and create one executable GitHub issue with BDD acceptance criteria.

  Scenario: AC1 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When /sdlc-draft-issue exercises this capability
    Then Given an initial need, when drafting begins, then the workflow gathers only material missing decisions through bounded interactive gates.

  Scenario: AC2 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When /sdlc-draft-issue exercises this capability
    Then Given approved issue text, when publishing, then exactly one feature or bug issue is created with testable BDD acceptance criteria.

  Scenario: AC3 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When /sdlc-draft-issue exercises this capability
    Then Given the issue is created, when the workflow completes, then /sdlc-write-spec #N is the next action.
